WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.318
Danny: Bello, we’re going to go now.

2
00:00:03.319 --> 00:00:06.124
Brad: It’s been nice meeting you.

3
00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:09.008
Tina: Your daddy will be home soon, okay?

4
00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:17.435
You stay here and wait for him.

5
00:00:17.436 --> 00:00:18.967
Bello: Bye-bye.

6
00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:21.149
Tina: Bye, Bello.

7
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.226
Brad: Well, let’s follow the little bug home.

8
00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:32.815
Danny: Okay, bug, show us the way.

9
00:00:32.816 --> 00:00:36.636
Going home now doesn’t feel very heroic.

10
00:00:36.637 --> 00:00:40.259
Tina: That’s because we’re not acting like heroes.

11
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.195
Brad: Why do you say that?

12
00:00:42.196 --> 00:00:45.004
Tina: We didn’t complete our mission.

13
00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:46.493
Danny: I don’t know.

14
00:00:46.494 --> 00:00:50.312
Maybe we did enough.

15
00:00:50.314 --> 00:00:52.993
This is not a happy place. Brad:

16
00:00:52.994 --> 00:00:55.342
Geez, look at the sun. It’s

17
00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:58.167
almost black. Tina:

18
00:00:58.168 --> 00:01:08.666
This place would be less gloomy if the sun were shining. Brad:

19
00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.665
It’s the same door as last time. Tina:

20
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:14.122
I don’t like the look of it. Danny:

21
00:01:14.123 --> 00:01:16.070
Hopian said we should go. We

22
00:01:16.071 --> 00:01:18.275
have to trust him. Tina:

23
00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.373
You first! Danny:

24
00:01:20.374 --> 00:01:25.037
Fine. I’m not scared. Tina:

25
00:01:25.038 --> 00:01:28.033
Maybe you are a little scared. Danny:

26
00:01:28.034 --> 00:01:32.333
No! Brad:

27
00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:35.464
Danny, what have you done! Tina:

28
00:01:35.465 --> 00:01:38.637
You squashed Hopian’s messenger bug!

29
00:01:38.638 --> 00:01:43.759
Danny: No! That is Hopian’s messenger bug!

30
00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.627
Brad: Then who sent the gray bug?

31
00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:50.870
Tina: It was a trap after all!

32
00:01:50.871 --> 00:01:54.846
Tristay: Nooo! Those kids were almost gone for good.

33
00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:58.467
Hopian, this is all your fault! Hopian:

34
00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:01.060
I don’t know what you mean. Tristay:

35
00:02:01.061 --> 00:02:04.192
You sent that red bug to warn them. Hopian:

36
00:02:04.193 --> 00:02:06.991
And what if I did? Tristay:

37
00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:11.166
You won’t try anything like that again after I punish you. Hopian:

38
00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:14.461
There’s nothing you can do to hurt me. Tristay:

39
00:02:14.462 --> 00:02:17.202
Oh yes, there is. Go

40
00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.358
get Hopian’s son! Hopian:

41
00:02:19.359 --> 00:02:22.583
No! Brad:

42
00:02:22.584 --> 00:02:27.496
I have a feeling that strange door didn’t lead back home. Danny:

43
00:02:27.497 --> 00:02:31.055
Home! We left Bello all alone at home!

44
00:02:31.056 --> 00:02:33.789
Tina: We have to get there quickly.

45
00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.587
Danny: Do you think Bello is safe?

46
00:02:36.588 --> 00:02:38.458
Brad: Tristay captured Hopian.

47
00:02:38.459 --> 00:02:41.770
He might try to capture Bello too.

48
00:02:41.772 --> 00:02:47.067
Tina: We have to run faster!

49
00:02:47.068 --> 00:02:51.751
All three: Bello! Bello!

50
00:02:51.752 --> 00:02:53.087
Tina: Come over here!

51
00:02:53.088 --> 00:02:55.225
The back door is open!

52
00:02:55.226 --> 00:02:57.485
Danny: We’re too late!

53
00:02:57.486 --> 00:03:03.245
Bello: Help!

